<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92656" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοιζ-έω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		 and 
			Ep.
		
		impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοίζεσκε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					835
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρροίζησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
				</span></i>
			 (v.infr.), 
				Ep.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοίζησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.502
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, v. infr.: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοῖζος</span>):—<i>whistle</i>, Il.l.c.; of a
			snake, <i>hiss</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.129
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑὸν νόμον ἐρροίζησε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					1.563
				</span></i>
			; of birds, <i>rush</i> or <i>whirr through the air</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Am.</u>
				22
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				535b27
			</span></i>: in late Prose, <i>shoot an arrow</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>4 Ki.</u>
				13.17
			</span></i> (cod. A); of a stream, ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ca.</u>
				4.15
			</span></i>:—so in 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰῶν τηλόθεν ῥοιζουμένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					1426
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1325
			</span></i>, Orac. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>App.Anth.</u>
				6.140.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάχ᾽ ἂν ἐρροίζητο δι᾽ αἰθέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.106
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Lucill.
			</span></i>); of a stream, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Orac.Chald.</u>
				109
			</span></i>.</div>
